# The ycashd a YecWallet release bundles (docs/release.md). Read by contrib/yecwallet-release/check-version.sh
# and .github/workflows/yecwallet-release.yml; parsed as KEY=VALUE lines, never sourced.
#
# The node is never "latest": it is ycash6's published release at YCASH6_TAG, and the workflow
# refuses to bundle it unless that tag names exactly YCASH6_COMMIT on the ycash6 repository, the
# ycash6 release's SHA256SUMS lists the package, its keyless cosign signature names ycash6's
# release workflow at that tag, and its minisign signature verifies against the Ycash release key.
#
# Set both values in the version-bump PR from the workspace train file
# releases/v<version>.yaml: YCASH6_TAG = ycash6.tag, YCASH6_COMMIT = the commit that tag names
# (`git ls-remote https://github.com/boyfromcave/ycash6.git refs/tags/<tag>^{}`, or the tag
# itself when it is lightweight). In beta2 the tag names the train's ycash6.commit (fbc9f625c);
# should the two ever differ, the packages, and so this pin, are the tag's, and the difference
# belongs in the train file. YCASH6_TAG must equal v<APP_VERSION> of src/version.h:
# a wallet release bundles the node release of the same version. "unset" is refused by a tag.
YCASH6_REPO=boyfromcave/ycash6
YCASH6_TAG=v6.23.0-beta4
# upgrade/yugen: the Yugen line bundles ycash6 v6.23.0-beta4 (tagged on ycash6 upgrade/yugen; the
# annotated tag names this commit).
YCASH6_COMMIT=90fe3341095fe37b04edecc61a24a1001b15a420
